OL,3,GNEWSAInquest shown moment man is shot
OL,4,Aby armed police
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors were shown police footage of
OL,7,FKuzmenko being shot eight times by two
OL,8,Fofficers, who have been granted
OL,9,Fanonymity, before attempts were made to
OL,10,Fresuscitate him.
